The supported surface is what the rendered repository, its READMEs, tests, and
commands actually provide. DataLad, Git LFS, alternate schedulers, automatic
scientific record acceptance, and undocumented reporting backends are not
implied features. Add a capability only with implementation, documentation,
conditional rendering, migration behavior, and validation together.
